      "content": "i know, i know, but calling an ambulance is so expensive and i really can't leave work right now. levels of stress have been insane. is there anything i can take right now to just calm my heart down and make the pressure go away? like maybe an antacid or something for the anxiety? i just want to get through the afternoon.",
